<title>BULGARIA: WEATHER FORECAST - BULGARIA - AUGUST 1 - SUNNY.</title>
<headline>WEATHER FORECAST - BULGARIA - AUGUST 1 - SUNNY.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sunny and warm across the</p>
<p>country, state radio said.</p>
<p>Maximum temperatures are expected between 27 and 33 degrees, temperature  in Sofia is seen at about 28 degrees.</p>
<p>Air temperatures along the Black Sea coast are expected between 28  and 30 degrees. -- Sofia Newsroom, 359-2-91188</p>
</text>
